docs/production-size.md:1:# Product scope
docs/production-size.md:2:
docs/production-size.md:3:The repository contains the common HVAC client, legacy comfort flows, and model-program property
docs/production-size.md:4:overrides released for SA8155, SA8295, and Xinqing cockpit programs. Product overrides remain in
docs/production-size.md:5:code because several SOP branches still depend on their historical signal mappings.
docs/platforms.md:1:# Platforms
docs/platforms.md:2:
